By Lemma~\ref{tq-00K3}, the bound \eqref{tq-00K3-eq00} holds for a fixed $x_0$. The covering estimate of \ref{tq-00B7} then gives the radius. For sets that are not compact see \cite{tq-00B1-ref}.
